  "macros": [],
  "_ft8": [
    "Assign any button: short press adjust_ft8_rx_tx toggles RX/TX preview; long press set_ft8_frequency commits the selected frequency. This sample uses Button 6 in Normal mode.",
    "Home CC100 uses selected_adjustment with Wheel A output. Dial movement positions a dashed preview until Set is pressed.",
    "TX commit enables Hold TX. RX commit opens My QSO at that audio frequency. All continues showing the full band.",
    "Only Switch RX/TX tone and Set tone frequency are offered. Older RX/TX assignments migrate to Switch on short press and Set on long press. Import replaces the entire map; edit individual assignments to preserve a customized map."
  ]
